          "end": 34.53,
          "en": "just as we outsourced the logic",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 34.53,
          "end": 36.813,
          "en": "for deriving which player is active.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 38.1,
          "end": 40.65,
          "en": "So, therefore, I'll add a new function outside",
