          "id": 15,
          "start": 40.65,
          "end": 44.343,
          "en": "of the app component, which we could name derive winner,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.75,
          "end": 49.323,
          "en": "and I'll paste that code into this function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 50.34,
          "end": 52.77,
          "en": "Now, in this function, we'll need the game board",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 52.77,
          "end": 57.273,
          "en": "and the player's data so we can accept both as parameters.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 58.71,
          "end": 60.72,
          "en": "And, of course, in the end here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 60.72,
          "end": 62.7,
          "en": "since this is a helper function,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
