        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 155.79,
          "end": 159.51,
          "en": "And with that, this app component became much leaner.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 159.51,
          "end": 162.03,
          "en": "We can now also delete those comments,",
